{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take flight in <i>Bird Simulator 24</i>, an outrageous action game where you reclaim your rightful territory from the humans and assert your genetic dominance! As a fearless bird, your mission is simple: rule the skies, reclaim your homeland, and fight the humans in the most hilarious ways imaginable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you restore peace to the park?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the plot of the corrupt mayor scheming to demolish it, and fight to protect the greenery in all-new story mode missions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262870/extras/d3045850e9ddc18a2d874bb0cd279fa4.avif?t=1759130680\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262870/extras_big/d3045850e9ddc18a2d874bb0cd279fa4.avif?t=1759130680 width=800 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eat Anything You See!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge and devour everything that crosses your path! Every bite helps you rack up points and trigger special power-ups. The more you eat, the more chaos you can unleash!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262870/extras/63aff8c42d4f3e48d814270a9f44680e.avif?t=1759130680\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262870/extras_big/63aff8c42d4f3e48d814270a9f44680e.avif?t=1759130680 width=800 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Skins and Hats!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization is key to showing off your birdly style! Collect and unlock dozens of unique skins and hats for your bird.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262870/extras/cc6285c460851ef561f53a95085bc0bc.avif?t=1759130680\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262870/extras_big/cc6285c460851ef561f53a95085bc0bc.avif?t=1759130680 width=800 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash Birdly Vengeance on Humans!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use anything in the environment to your advantage\u2014trash cans, benches, cardboard boxes, and even ice cream stalls! Various edible items can come in handy providing a variety of combat effects, such as fireworks or donut immunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262870/extras/bbdf19fd7c77e4edb70840cc2fba01f0.avif?t=1759130680\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262870/extras_big/bbdf19fd7c77e4edb70840cc2fba01f0.avif?t=1759130680 width=800 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Poop with Precision!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate weapon in your arsenal: poop! Aim carefully as you dive-bomb targets from the sky. Time your shots perfectly to hit unsuspecting humans and cause maximum chaos. Precision pooping has never been more fun\u2014or deadly.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262870/extras/5c0b057c4e13e471cb7f726770b0feed.avif?t=1759130680\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262870/extras_big/5c0b057c4e13e471cb7f726770b0feed.avif?t=1759130680 width=800 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Hidden Secrets in a World Full of Surprises!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world filled with quirky secrets and hidden areas. Can you uncover all secrets?  Only the most cunning and adventurous birds will find them all!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262870/extras/be6d4c61ad7ef3723108b1b5dc45d4a2.avif?t=1759130680\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262870/extras_big/be6d4c61ad7ef3723108b1b5dc45d4a2.avif?t=1759130680 width=800 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to reclaim the skies and become the ultimate bird overlord?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I'm under the water","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3262870/a6263cbe5803a949d42e8917210c1c3be10f34fa.jpg"},{"name":"Hells Bell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3262870/415f04da7faf52e5b9a874bd820583b1f9256ab5.jpg"},{"name":"Metal Warrior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3262870/3257721dfc54a62c27ee9968070330c222c0e2fe.jpg"},{"name":"Diomofon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3262870/7746e849607ed97b90758a3e8e761b058cdc3f80.jpg"},{"name":"Hello, how are you?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3262870/10b0681ab76f86e53d0a9da24bc42db86d5e3d60.jpg"},{"name":"1700s Sea Shanties","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3262870/08ea67ea2cd674e058d35e27a90bce5174997dfd.jpg"},{"name":"Bonjour","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3262870/ee73800d6d5df331d408553fa248da16fce1a2f8.jpg"},{"name":"Guess Who's Back","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3262870/c84549d32531e636658335aa809d3bf6fb77513e.jpg"},{"name":"Golden Fountains","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3262870/db64a0fc51e2cd559910badbcbb087e4ff64504c.jpg"},{"name":"Golden Forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.stea