al: poop! Aim carefully as you dive-bomb targets from the sky. Time your shots perfectly to hit unsuspecting humans and cause maximum chaos. Precision pooping has never been more fun\u2014or deadly.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262870/extras/5c0b057c4e13e471cb7f726770b0feed.avif?t=1759130680\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262870/extras_big/5c0b057c4e13e471cb7f726770b0feed.avif?t=1759130680 width=800 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Hidden Secrets in a World Full of Surprises!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world filled with quirky secrets and hidden areas. Can you uncover all secrets?  Only the most cunning and adventurous birds will find them all!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262870/extras/be6d4c61ad7ef3723108b1b5dc45d4a2.avif?t=1759130680\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262870/extras_big/be6d4c61ad7ef3723108b1b5dc45d4a2.avif?t=1759130680 width=800 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to reclaim the skies and become the ultimate bird overlord?</strong></p>","developers":["PROJECT RAGDOLL"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262870/header.jpg?t=1759130680","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommen